{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_4_002_02_i",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:cb39625ac2b518f880f37a765ea40ab99f5bc64258804ec8bd843cb40b241257",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000020:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bc037364ea67d84d08662cb4d354d11e478304ff72d96252d17893cac540bf7a",
      "text": "后半场结束后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000029:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2f549a5e31fe3c529f3f1cb2c891601ea53e1c6766c8ccc67e43e5870e8bfa08",
      "text": "录制演播厅",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad0f98a92b02db01671e6ebca5f47361596e680dbeecb8c151dd7cd208336a06",
      "text": "出来了吗，后半场的结果！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:930aafdd8e50588594f0d91806088cdecd1c46eec50acd2b20a1db6847c56708",
      "text": "虽然差距很小，但北斗先生目前是第一名。\n胜负将由接下来的最终决战来定夺！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:79341acda028dd10ecbe8757d90c600695174bb06b6d460f052e0137ea2df696",
      "text": "去撩工作人员那台进水报废的智能手机就可以了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e3579d7c75e6b5f7364d6ae8a8a57b432fca2b16263254573d1f10bf708d685",
      "text": "嗯。这次不是人类，而是对万物代表的\n智能手机搭话后，按下电源键……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c8b3602007beceb669b5d960b321a8403c65c064bf1e36c9bbb766bc754ec195",
      "text": "如果顺利开机，就算作“回应了自己的呼唤”，\n追加10000pt！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:203b12aaa607a4e24616070a4b1c0f05efb70972790c670c6df455b0dca0ff26",
      "text": "不管对手是智能手机还是什么都无所谓。\n让它开机的人，绝对会是我！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000073:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3c86f745751e124ae84a97ea629e5fa7b068cf4f17cc673342423bfe19e04e1e",
      "text": "虽然搞不太懂为什么这样就能决定谁是万人迷，\n不过都走到这一步了，怎么可能输呢♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:036ca581b143e71b230c1e71f5a79a776649a5751970ba74070c0f8c09a294be",
      "text": "不管对方是什么，我也不觉得自己会输呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4775af1dafab999a840b25aad3b235675a17473c0f59f3b64e506c8d79ccde9d",
      "text": "挑战顺序依次是冬马先生、北斗先生、翔太先生。\n大家请加油哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_4_002_02:1_4_002_02_i:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5b20dbf03c04583c34840757f14deaaf5b7b782796ba7738947d3d5e6d6cf8f",
      "text": "哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
